          {
            "id": "305",
            "title": "Footer",
            "alias": "footer",
            "categoryId": "56",
            "categoryTitle": "School Homepage Articles",
            "introtext": "\t<div class=\"footer-wrapper\">\n<div class=\"footer-content\">\n<h1><a href=\"school\">St. Christopher School</a></h1>\n<p><a href=\"about-st-christopher-school/contact-us\">5335 W. 16th Street, Speedway, IN 46224</a><br />Office: <a href=\"tel:3172416315\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">(317) 241-6315</a> Fax: (317) 244-6678</p>\n</div>\n<div class=\"footer-buttons\"><a class=\"button\" href=\"admissions/apply-now-or-re-enroll\">Apply Now or Re-Enroll</a><a class=\"button\" href=\"admissions/why-choose-catholic-education\">The Benefits of Catholic Education</a><a class=\"button\" href=\"https://www.archindy.org/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">ArchdioceseWebsite</a><a class=\"button\" href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=xmmtD-2qS6I\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">SGO<br />Informational<br />Video</a><a class=\"button\" href=\"https://www.i4qed.org/sgo/donors\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">SGO Tax CreditScholarship DonorPage</a></div>\n<div class=\"ptp-wrapper\">\n<div class=\"ptp-logo\"><img src=\"images/template/promise-to-protect.png\" alt=\"\" /></div>\n<div class=\"ptp-content\">\n<h3>Our Promise to Protect</h3>\n<p>Ensuring a safe environment for all, especially children and vulnerable adults, is a top priority of the clergy, staff, and parishioners of St. Christopher Parish in Speedway, Indiana. We are committed to upholding the highest standards of conduct and fostering a culture of awareness, accountability, and care. We invite you to review the “Promise to Protect” materials and Safe Environment policies available in the parish office and on our bulletin boards. If you have questions or would like more information about how we can work together to keep our parish, homes, and community safe, please contact our Safe Environment Coordinator. <br /><br />To report suspected abuse of a minor, please contact the Archdiocese of Indianapolis Victim Assistance Line at <span style=\"color: #000000;\"><a style=\"color: #000000;\" href=\"(317) 236-1548\">(317) 236-1548</a> or (<a style=\"color: #000000;\" href=\"800) 382-9836\">800) 382-9836</a>, ext. 1548</span>, or emai<span style=\"color: #000000;\">l <a style=\"color: #000000;\" href=\"mailto:victimassistance@archindy.org\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">victimassistance@archindy.org</a>.  </span>Reports may also be made directly to local law enforcement authorities. The Archdiocese of Indianapolis is committed to reporting all allegations of abuse to the appropriate authorities and supporting all those affected..</p>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>",
            "fulltext": "",
            "state": "1",
            "access": "1"
          }
        ]
